<div class="workflow-cards" role="region" aria-label="Workflows">
  <div class="feature-card">
    <h3>Chat</h3>
    <p>Ask a question and get an answer in the Thread. Chat requests are sent read-only: the Worker answers and does not change files.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <h3>Work</h3>
    <p>Give a Worker a task to carry out on the host computer, such as editing a document or changing code in the Space's folder.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <h3>Research</h3>
    <p>Several Workers look into the same question in parallel, then one combines their findings into a single comparison.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    <h3>Implement</h3>
    <p>A full engineering cycle, <strong>Plan → Implement → Test → Verify</strong>, with each step and its result recorded in the Thread.</p>
  </div>
</div>
